    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mt-2">Head</h1>
    <p class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mt-2">Head acupressure focuses on the scalp, forehead, and skull base. Points like GV20 (Baihui) and GB20 (Fengchi) are traditional targets for headaches, dizziness, mental fatigue, and stress-related tension.</p>
  </div>
